---
# SelfCheck is a test, the one on the target (docs/Testing.md), and keeps the
# limits of a test:
# readability-function-size.LineThreshold: a check of many cases is long but
#   flat; its parameters, nesting and complexity keep the library's limits.
InheritParentConfig: true
CheckOptions:
  readability-function-size.LineThreshold: none
